我就在这里，听着你把那些堵在心里的、觉得累的、甚至有点无力的感觉倒出来。你慢慢说，我听着。", "emotion_label": "anger", "user_profile": {"personality_traits": ["sensitive"], "interests": ["film_animation"], "style": ["direct"]}, "memory_refs": []}

